      "content": "i get that, but it doesnt feel like \"identity theft\" or a mistake. mistake or not, it feels like they're doing this on purpose to drain my balance so i can't maintain the minimum or something. if i call the fraud department, wouldnt they just be talking to the same people who are doing this to me? i'm just looking for ways to protect my money and stay ahead of them before they do something more drastic. is there any way to move my funds or change how i use my account so they cant keep catching me off guard?",
